  "prefLabel": "En 1007.01 Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1007.01 Eligibility. Simplified process review shall be available to any certified inverter-based facility that has a nameplate rating that does not exceed 50 kW and has an export capacity of 25 kW or less. If the facility’s export capacity is not limited, the nameplate rating shall not exceed 25 kW.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
}
